[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "Lesson 107 It's too small.",
    "start": 0.69,
    "end": 5.971,
    "zh": "第107课 它太小了。",
    "zh_hant": "第107課 它太小了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "Listen to the tape then answer this question.",
    "start": 7.331,
    "end": 12.192,
    "zh": "听录音,然后回答这个问题。",
    "zh_hant": "聽錄音,然後回答這個問題。"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "What kind of dress does the Lady want?",
    "start": 13.357,
    "end": 17.118,
    "zh": "这位女士想要什么样的连衣裙？",
    "zh_hant": "這位女士想要什麼樣的連衣裙？"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "Do you like this dress, madam?",
    "start": 19.2,
    "end": 22.321,
    "zh": "夫人，您喜欢这条连衣裙吗？",
    "zh_hant": "夫人，您喜歡這條連衣裙嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "I like the colour very much.",
    "start": 23.522,
    "end": 26.703,
    "zh": "我非常喜欢这个颜色。",
    "zh_hant": "我非常喜歡這個顏色。"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "It's a lovely dress,",
    "start": 27.023,
    "end": 29.264,
    "zh": "这是一条可爱的连衣裙，",
    "zh_hant": "這是一條可愛的連衣裙，"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "but it's too small for me.",
    "start": 29.305,
    "end": 32.066,
    "zh": "但对我来说太小了。",
    "zh_hant": "但對我來說太小了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "What about this one?",
    "start": 33.227,
    "end": 35.487,
    "zh": "这条怎么样？",
    "zh_hant": "這條怎麼樣？"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "It's a lovely dress.",
    "start": 35.768,
    "end": 38.069,
    "zh": "这是一条可爱的连衣裙。",
    "zh_hant": "這是一條可愛的連衣裙。"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "It's very smart.",
    "start": 38.369,
    "end": 40.47,
    "zh": "它很时髦。",
    "zh_hant": "它很時髦。"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "Short skirts are in fashion now.",
    "start": 41.011,
    "end": 44.232,
    "zh": "现在流行短裙。",
    "zh_hant": "現在流行短裙。"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "Would you like to try it?",
    "start": 44.612,
    "end": 46.953,
    "zh": "您想试试吗？",
    "zh_hant": "您想試試嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "All right.",
    "start": 47.654,
    "end": 48.854,
    "zh": "好的。",
    "zh_hant": "好的。"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "I'm afraid this green dress",
    "start": 49.915,
    "end": 53.036,
    "zh": "恐怕这条绿色的连衣裙",
    "zh_hant": "恐怕這條綠色的連衣裙"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "is too small for me as well.",
    "start": 52.997,
    "end": 56.738,
    "zh": "对我来说也太小了。",
    "zh_hant": "對我來說也太小了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "It's smaller than the blue one.",
    "start": 57.899,
    "end": 61.52,
    "zh": "它比那条蓝色的还小。",
    "zh_hant": "它比那條藍色的還小。"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "I don't like the colour either.",
    "start": 62.681,
    "end": 65.642,
    "zh": "我也不喜欢这个颜色。",
    "zh_hant": "我也不喜歡這個顏色。"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "It doesn't suit me at all.",
    "start": 66.203,
    "end": 69.504,
    "zh": "它完全不适合我。",
    "zh_hant": "它完全不適合我。"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "I think the blue dress is prettier.",
    "start": 70.185,
    "end": 73.927,
    "zh": "我觉得蓝色的那条更漂亮。",
    "zh_hant": "我覺得藍色的那條更漂亮。"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "Could you show me another blue dress?",
    "start": 74.687,
    "end": 78.749,
    "zh": "能给我看看另一条蓝色的连衣裙吗？",
    "zh_hant": "能給我看看另一條藍色的連衣裙嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "I want a dress like that one,",
    "start": 79.53,
    "end": 82.573,
    "zh": "我想要一条像那样的连衣裙，",
    "zh_hant": "我想要一條像那樣的連衣裙，"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "but it must be my size.",
    "start": 82.754,
    "end": 86.017,
    "zh": "但必须是我的尺码。",
    "zh_hant": "但必須是我的尺碼。"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "I'm afraid I haven't got",
    "start": 87.379,
    "end": 90.462,
    "zh": "恐怕我没有",
    "zh_hant": "恐怕我沒有"
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "text": "a larger dress.",
    "start": 90.203,
    "end": 92.124,
    "zh": "更大号的连衣裙。",
    "zh_hant": "更大號的連衣裙。"
  },
  {
    "index": 24,
    "text": "This is the largest dress in the shop.",
    "start": 92.545,
    "end": 96.79,
    "zh": "这是店里最大的连衣裙了。",
    "zh_hant": "這是店裡最大的連衣裙了。"
  }
]
